      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>bandwidthPerMigration</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the bandwidth of each migration in bytes per second. For example, a value of 2048Mi means 2048 MiB/s. Default: 0, which is unlimited.</p></dd>
