      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies whether the post copy mode is enabled. You can enable post copy mode to allow the migration of one node to another to converge, even if a VM is running a heavy workload and the memory dirty rate is too high. By default, <code>allowPostCopy</code> is set to <code>false</code>.</p></dd>
